{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "root": {
    "type": "Grid",
    "props": {
      "columns": 12,
      "gap": 16
    },
    "children": [
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "summary",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "variant": "hero"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "summary"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "KPIStrip",
            "id": "summary_kpistrip",
            "props": {
              "items": [
                {
                  "label": "Send Mail steps",
                  "field": "send_mail_steps",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "via SMTP",
                  "field": "via_smtp",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "email_integration",
                      "params": {
                        "mode": "SMTP"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "via Client",
                  "field": "via_client",
                  "format": "number",
                  "onClick": {
                    "action": "openDashboard",
                    "args": {
                      "id": "email_integration",
                      "params": {
                        "mode": "Client"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                },
                {
                  "label": "Hard-coded credentials",
                  "field": "hardcoded_credentials",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "MBS mail calls",
                  "field": "mbs_mail_calls",
                  "format": "number"
                },
                {
                  "label": "Files affected",
                  "field": "files_affected",
                  "format": "number"
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "by_mode",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "By delivery mode"
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "by_mode"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "by_mode_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "mode",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "mode",
                  "label": "Mode",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "callsites",
                  "label": "Call sites",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "files",
                  "label": "Files",
                  "align": "right"
                },
                {
                  "field": "with_hardcoded_auth",
                  "label": "Hard-coded auth",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openDashboard",
                "args": {
                  "id": "email_integration",
                  "params": {
                    "mode": "{{mode}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Card",
        "id": "findings",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "title": "Call sites",
          "keepChildrenOnEmpty": true
        },
        "data": {
          "dataset": "findings"
        },
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "Table",
            "id": "findings_table",
            "props": {
              "rowKey": "row_key",
              "density": "compact",
              "sortable": true,
              "pageParam": "page",
              "searchParam": "q",
              "sortParam": "sort",
              "clientMode": true,
              "columns": [
                {
                  "field": "mode",
                  "label": "Mode",
                  "format": "badge"
                },
                {
                  "field": "mechanism",
                  "label": "Mechanism"
                },
                {
                  "field": "carrier",
                  "label": "Script/Object"
                },
                {
                  "field": "smtp_host",
                  "label": "SMTP host"
                },
                {
                  "field": "hardcoded_auth",
                  "label": "Hard-coded auth",
                  "format": "boolean"
                },
                {
                  "field": "file",
                  "label": "File"
                },
                {
                  "field": "step_index",
                  "label": "#",
                  "align": "right"
                }
              ],
              "onRowClick": {
                "action": "openObject",
                "args": {
                  "uuid": "{{nav_uuid}}",
                  "type": "{{nav_type}}",
                  "file": "{{file}}",
                  "params": {
                    "step": "{{step_uuid}}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "Markdown",
        "id": "markdown",
        "props": {
          "span": 12,
          "content": "## Notes\n\nOutbound **email**. *Send Mail* (Step_ID 63) is classified by delivery path from the DDR step text: **SMTP server** vs. **email client**. When the step uses an SMTP server, the host is extracted; a step carrying an inline `Password:` is flagged as **hard-coded credentials** (a security finding — the password value itself is never displayed). MBS `SendMail.*` / `EmailParser.*` calls are read from the resolved `calls_pluginfunction` links.\n\n- **KPIs as filters**: *via SMTP* and *via Client* filter the detail list.\n- **Hard-coded credentials**: SMTP server, port and password baked into the step break on deployment and leak secrets into the DDR.\n- **Scope**: cURL-based SMTP (`MBS:CURL.*`) stays in the *APIs & external interfaces* dashboard.\n- **Navigation**: clicking a call site opens the carrier (Script + step anchor, or the object behind an MBS call).\n- **Related rules**: derived severity rules live under *Static Code Analysis*.\n- **Sorting**: all column headings are clickable (▲▼)."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
